## Phase 11 — Lightweight Render Graph

**Goal:** Keep pass/resource ownership clean as the rasterizer grows.

The graph should describe dependencies and resource lifetime; it must not become a giant abstraction layer around SDL_GPU.

Example:

```text
Depth
